    "content": "**Detailed comparison — [Demo] Riverside office lighting** (RFQ `demo-contractor-demo-supplier-demo-lighting`, rev 1, USD, deadline 2026-10-02, two quotes received)\nRead-only recheck: `compare_quotes` plus registered percentage calculations on the stored quote totals. No drafts, sends, awards or writes.\n\n**Scope coverage** — both quotes marked complete, same items/quantities as the request: 120 × \"36 W LED panel, 4000 K, 3-year warranty\" and 24 × \"Ceiling occupancy sensor with commissioning\".\n\n**Lines and totals**\n\n| Item | Summit Supply (quote-1, rev 1) | Atlas Materials (quote-2, rev 1) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Panel 36 W | 120 × 42.50 = 5,100 | 120 × 39.80 = 4,776 |\n| Sensor + commissioning | 24 × 18.00 = 432 | 24 × 21.50 = 516 |\n| **Recorded total** | **5,532 USD** | **5,292 USD** |\n\n**Difference: 240 (Atlas lower; tool savingsVsHighest = 240).** Composition: Atlas is 324 cheaper on panels (2.70/unit × 120) but 84 dearer on sensors (3.50/unit × 24).\n\n**Lead time** — Summit 14 days; Atlas 35 days (flagged long lead). 21-day spread.\n\n**Payment terms, with calculated amounts** (illustrative splits of recorded totals, not agreed schedules):\n- Summit, \"30% deposit; 70% after delivery\": 30% of 5,532.00 = **1,659.60**; 70% = **3,872.40** (remainders 3,872.40 / 1,659.60; source seq 83).\n- Atlas, \"100% advance payment\": 100% of 5,292.00 = **5,292.00**, remainder **0.00** (source seq 85) — 3,632.40 more up front than Summit's deposit.\n\n**Missing facts** — no declared tax mode/rate, freight amount, validity or delivery window on either quote; freight only appears in notes (\"included\" in Atlas's note; Summit's note says freight and 3-year warranty included). Atlas's note also asks to confirm the delivery window. So neither total is a verified delivered/tax-inclusive figure.\n\n**Risks flagged by the tool:** Atlas — long lead time, full advance cash exposure. Summit — none flagged.\n\n**Next steps (human review, nothing automated):** if programme timing dominates, get Summit's tax/freight and deposit position in writing; if up-front cash dominates, confirm Atlas's delivery window, warranty inclusion and whether the advance is negotiable. Ranking here is by total then lead time only — it does not establish best value or an award. Say the word and I'll prepare a private draft for your approval.",
